{"id":"n75006-4-7","stage":1,"title":"돌다 · 周转","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75006-4-7-1","ko":"요즘 사업 잘되세요?","zh":"最近生意还顺利吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"사업","meaning":"事业，生意","explanation":"사업：事业，生意。","readings":[{"term":"사업","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62048","senseId":"1","lemma":"사업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사업","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3"}},{"text":"잘되세요?","meaning":"顺利，好","explanation":"잘되다：顺利，好；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘되세요","audio":"/audio/a7e7bb0a4eeefde32900.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"7b3733aab2fd0dcf","term":"사업","zh":"事业，生意","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3","entryId":"62048","definition":"为取得经济利益而经营某种组织。","pronunciation":["사ː업"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"顺利，好","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"事情朝着理想的方向发展。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a477d7f491c55d59274b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75006-4-7-2","ko":"글쎄요, 시장에 돈이 잘 돌지 못해서 예전만큼은 벌지 못해요.","zh":"唉，因为市场上资金流通不畅，收入没以前那么高了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄요,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄요：也许吧，或许吧，难说。","readings":[{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}]